[en.FOCUS_C01_IDEOLOGY_POLICY]
Thought Rectification

[en.FOCUS_C01_IDEOLOGY_POLICY_desc]
As the “Empress of Friendship”, orthodoxy is very important for the rule of Cozy Glow. Only when ponies recognize the rule of the Empress from the ideological level, can the Empire of Equestria finally achieve stability.

[zh.FOCUS_C01_IDEOLOGY_POLICY]
思想纠正

[zh.FOCUS_C01_IDEOLOGY_POLICY_desc]
作为“友谊女皇”，正统性对于和煦光流统治的十分重要。只有小马们从思想上认同女皇的统治，小马利亚帝国才能最终获得安定。

